; planning. The normal AFTER run also checks the scalar remainder recurrences,
; whose starts change and whose flags may be conservatively dropped.
; Parallel metadata promises independence, not unsigned pointer nowrap.
; Keep the conditional load live with a store to the same outer iteration's
; address, so the conditional GEP reaches address analysis.

